exports[`buildHtml > snapshot: en-no-contact > checkDraft 1`] = `
{
  "body": "Dear Ege İplik Example team,

EU rules for textile traceability <DPP> & labelling are changing, and your site shows you already export to the EU.

The example platform lets exporters organise the compliance data their EU customers ask for once and reuse it for every customer.

Could I show you this in a 30-minute live demo, built on an example close to your own order flow? You can pick a time here: https://calendar.example.org/demo

Kind regards,

Defne Kılıç
Co-founder
Örnek Tekstil Danışmanlık A.Ş.
Kavaklı Sk.
No: 12, 06000 Çankaya/Ankara
https://www.texprove.example.org

We found your contact details on your company's public website.

If you would rather not receive emails like this, simply reply with "unsubscribe".",
  "notes": [],
  "status": "OK",
}
`;

